{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/worldmodule\/worldsnapshot"]}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/SavingAndLoadingWorlds","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Scene","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/TypeRegistry","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/TypeRegistryError","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/MapEntities"],"generated":true,"title":"Saving and Loading Worlds","anchor":"Saving-and-Loading-Worlds"}],"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"WorldSnapshot","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<each ","kind":"text"},{"text":"C","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":"> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"where","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" repeat each ","kind":"text"},{"text":"C","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Se","text":"Decodable","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", repeat each ","kind":"text"},{"text":"C","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SE","text":"Encodable","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", repeat each ","kind":"text"},{"text":"C","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule9ComponentP","text":"Component","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Component","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"]}]},{"kind":"mentions","mentions":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/SavingAndLoadingWorlds"]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Overview","anchor":"overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use a snapshot to save a world and restore it later, or to compare two worlds. A snapshot"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is "},{"code":"Codable","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", so you can encode it with any encoder, such as "},{"code":"JSONEncoder","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":". Take one with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/snapshot(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":", listing the component types to save, and rebuild a world from it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"with "},{"code":"World(restoring:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":". Each component type you save must conform to "},{"code":"Codable","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The following example saves a world as JSON and restores it:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["import Foundation","","var world = World()","let ship = world.spawn(Position(x: 1, y: 2), Health(current: 3))","let data = try JSONEncoder().encode(world.snapshot(Position.self, Health.self))","","let decoded = try JSONDecoder().decode(WorldSnapshot<Position, Health>.self, from: data)","let restored = World(restoring: decoded)","print(restored[Position.self, of: ship])","\/\/ Prints \"Position(x: 1.0, y: 2.0)\""]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Every entity handle, live or stale, means the same in the restored world as in the original,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"so handles you saved elsewhere stay valid. The restored world also hands out the same handles"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"from later spawns."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A snapshot holds no resources, hooks or change ticks, and the restored world’s components"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"are all added at its first tick. To save resources too, or to save a world without listing"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"its types at each call, use a "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Scene","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"aside","style":"note","name":"Note","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Decoding throws ","type":"text"},{"code":"DecodingError.dataCorrupted","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" for data that no world could have","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"produced, such as a component of an entity that isn’t live.","type":"text"}]}]}]}],"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule"]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A saved copy of a world’s entities, hierarchy and the components of the listed types."}],"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/WorldSnapshot\/init(from:)"],"generated":true,"title":"Initializers","anchor":"Initializers"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/WorldSnapshot\/count"],"generated":true,"title":"Instance Properties","anchor":"Instance-Properties"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/WorldSnapshot\/encode(to:)"],"generated":true,"title":"Instance Methods","anchor":"Instance-Methods"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/WorldSnapshot\/Equatable-Implementations"],"generated":true,"title":"Default Implementations","anchor":"Default-Implementations"}],"relationshipsSections":[{"kind":"relationships","type":"conformsTo","identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/s8CopyableP","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/Se","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/SE","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/SQ","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/s9EscapableP","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"title":"Conforms To"}],"metadata":{"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"WorldSnapshot"}],"remoteSource":{"fileName":"Snapshot.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\